{"id":"wb-6-557","name":"宁海古戏台","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"宁海古戏台","text":"宁海古戏台是浙江省宁海县境内的各种修建于明清和民国时期的戏台的总称。宁海县现存古戏台120余座，其中以城隍庙古戏台等10座为代表，2006年被列入全国重点文物保护单位。这些戏台大都自成风格，拥有多元组合的彩绘藻井，结构华丽。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%81%E6%B5%B7%E5%8F%A4%E6%88%8F%E5%8F%B0","revisionId":84932891,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84932891","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1cddf4466cf0c722d13e0d39.jpg","title":"Yu's_Ancestral_Hall_in_Ma'ao_Village_10_2015-10.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yu%27s_Ancestral_Hall_in_Ma%27ao_Village_10_2015-10.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/60/Yu%27s_Ancestral_Hall_in_Ma%27ao_Village_10_2015-10.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​马岙村俞氏宗祠，戏台。","width":320,"height":213}}